          "reviewId": "personal-material-20260924:day"
        },
        {
          "id": "material:day_pillar:丁卯:02:tension",
          "text": "心配が膨らむと、想像の中で悲観を深めてしまうことがあります。",
          "refs": [
            "DP04-006"
          ],
          "kind": "astrological_interpretation",
          "scope": "common",
          "owner": {
            "family": "day_pillar",
            "key": "丁卯"
          },
          "reviewStatus": "material_reviewed",
          "withheldReasons": [],
          "reviewId": "personal-material-20260924:day"
        },
        {
          "id": "material:day_pillar:丁卯:02:advice",
          "text": "考える期間に区切りを置くと、心配が想像の中で膨らむ前に決められます。",
          "refs": [
            "DP04-006"
          ],
          "kind": "editorial_advice",
          "scope": "common",
          "owner": {
            "family": "day_pillar",
            "key": "丁卯"
          },
          "reviewStatus": "legacy_unreviewed",
          "withheldReasons": [],
          "derivedFrom": [
            "material:day_pillar:丁卯:02:tension"
          ],
          "derivationNote": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "material:shukuyo:角宿:02:conclusion",
          "text": "興味が湧くと、長く考え込む前に行動へ移ります。何かに夢中になっていても、現状をより良くする視点は保つ人です。",
          "refs": [
            "SY12-004",
            "SY12-006",
            "SY12-033",
            "SY12-038",
            "SY12-039",
            "SY12-044"
          ],
          "kind": "astrological_interpretation",
