          },
          "reviewStatus": "material_reviewed",
          "withheldReasons": [],
          "reviewId": "personal-material-20260924:day"
        },
        {
          "id": "material:day_pillar:丁卯:05:detail",
          "text": "仕事では、関心のある分野へ力を集中し、一度本腰を入れると燃え尽きるほど取り組みます。",
          "refs": [
            "DP04-046"
          ],
          "kind": "astrological_interpretation",
          "scope": "common",
          "owner": {
            "family": "day_pillar",
            "key": "丁卯"
          },
          "reviewStatus": "material_reviewed",
          "withheldReasons": [],
          "reviewId": "personal-material-20260924:day"
        },
        {
          "id": "material:day_pillar:丁卯:05:advice",
          "text": "本腰を入れる前に、その時期は人の変化を拾う量を減らすとよいでしょう。",
          "refs": [
            "DP04-008",
            "DP04-046"
          ],
          "kind": "editorial_advice",
          "scope": "common",
          "owner": {
            "family": "day_pillar",
