          "scope": "common",
          "scopeBasis": "gender_scope",
          "exclusionReasons": [],
          "text": "気持ちを深く注いだ相手には、関係が終わっても未練が残りやすい面があります。",
          "urls": [
            "https://unkoi.com/article/shukuyo_15_boushuku/"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "場の空気や人の変化を細かく拾い、負担にも感じます。",
          "refs": [
            "DP04-008"
          ],
          "kind": "astrological_interpretation"
        },
        {
          "text": "関心のある仕事に力を集中し、一度本腰を入れると燃え尽きるほど取り組むことがあります。",
          "refs": [
            "DP04-046",
            "SY15-059"
          ],
          "kind": "astrological_interpretation"
        },
        {
          "text": "よく考える力が、動けないほどの考えすぎになることがあります。一度生まれた疑いを手放しにくい面もあります。",
          "refs": [
            "SY15-012",
            "SY15-015"
          ],
          "kind": "astrological_interpretation"
        },
        {
          "text": "気持ちを深く注いだ相手には、関係が終わっても未練が残りやすいところがあります。",
          "refs": [
            "SY15-064"
          ],
          "kind": "astrological_interpretation"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "composition-20260924:丁卯:角宿:09",
      "conditions": {
        "dayPillar": "丁卯",
        "mansion": "角宿"
      },
      "sectionId": "09_関係の築き方",
      "reason": "相手任せと献身を同時に断定せず判定限界を明記。原資料にない本音と建前・交際段階などの使い分けは作らない。冒頭は理想像を重ねる行動に具体化。",
      "beforeParagraphs": [
        {
          "id": "material:day_pillar:丁卯:09:conclusion",
          "text": "夢を実現したい気持ちが恋愛にも向かい、理想とする関係の水準が高くなりやすいでしょう。",
          "refs": [
            "DP04-033"
          ],
          "kind": "astrological_interpretation",
          "scope": "common",
          "owner": {
            "family": "day_pillar",
            "key": "丁卯"
          },
          "reviewStatus": "material_reviewed",
          "withheldReasons": [],
          "reviewId": "personal-material-20260924:day"
        },
        {
          "id": "material:day_pillar:丁卯:09:detail",
          "text": "恋では直感で動き、気遣いと甘い雰囲気を大切にします。束縛を避け、関係を続ける努力が相手任せになりやすいでしょう。",
          "refs": [
            "DP04-026",
            "DP04-030"
          ],
          "kind": "astrological_interpretation",
          "scope": "common",
          "owner": {
            "family": "day_pillar",
            "key": "丁卯"
          },
          "reviewStatus": "material_reviewed",
          "withheldReasons": [],
          "reviewId": "personal-material-20260924:day"
        },
        {
          "id": "material:day_pillar:丁卯:09:tension",
          "text": "想像した理想像を相手に重ね、実際の相手を見失う場合があります。相手の欠点も含めて受け止めることが課題になります。",
          "refs": [
            "DP04-027",
            "DP04-028"
          ],
          "kind": "editorial_advice",
          "scope": "common",
          "owner": {
            "family": "day_pillar",
            "key": "丁卯"
          },
          "reviewStatus": "material_reviewed",
          "withheldReasons": [],
          "derivedFrom": [
            "material:day_pillar:丁卯:09:conclusion"
          ],
          "derivationNote": "DP04-033に基づく09conclusionは、恋愛で理想とする関係の水準が高くなりやすい性質を説明する。ここでDP04-027の理想像を重ねて実際の相手を見失う場合を補い、DP04-028の欠点も含めて受け止めるという原要旨の助言を、その同じ読者に保つ。関係改善の成功は保証しない。",
          "reviewId": "personal-material-20260924:day"
        },
        {
          "id": "material:day_pillar:丁卯:09:advice",
          "text": "理想像を重ねていると感じた時は、相手の実際の言葉を思い出してください。",
          "refs": [
            "DP04-027",
            "DP04-028"
          ],
          "kind": "editorial_advice",
          "scope": "common",
          "owner": {
            "family": "day_pillar",
            "key": "丁卯"
          },
          "reviewStatus": "legacy_unreviewed",
          "withheldReasons": [],
          "derivedFrom": [
            "material:day_pillar:丁卯:09:tension"
          ],
          "derivationNote": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "material:shukuyo:角宿:09:conclusion",
          "text": "一緒に過ごす時間を楽しめることを重視します。相手を楽しませようと、場を盛り上げることに力を注ぎます。",
          "refs": [
            "SY12-007",
            "SY12-019",
            "SY12-063"
          ],
          "kind": "astrological_interpretation",
          "scope": "common",
          "owner": {
            "family": "shukuyo",
            "key": "角宿"
          },
          "reviewStatus": "material_reviewed",
          "withheldReasons": [],
          "reviewId": "personal-material-20260924:mansion"
        },
        {
          "id": "material:shukuyo:角宿:09:detail",
          "text": "本気の相手には、細かなところまで尽くす面があります。",
          "refs": [
            "SY12-054"
          ],
          "kind": "astrological_interpretation",
          "scope": "common",
          "owner": {
            "family": "shukuyo",
            "key": "角宿"
          },
          "reviewStatus": "material_reviewed",
          "withheldReasons": [],
          "reviewId": "personal-material-20260924:mansion"
        },
        {
          "id": "material:shukuyo:角宿:09:tension",
          "text": "一方で、自分の自由は守りたいのに、相手には制約を求めることがあります。",
          "refs": [
            "SY12-007",
            "SY12-008",
            "SY12-019",
            "SY12-036",
            "SY12-054",
            "SY12-063"
          ],
          "kind": "astrological_interpretation",
          "scope": "common",
          "owner": {
            "family": "shukuyo",
            "key": "角宿"
          },
          "reviewStatus": "material_reviewed",
          "withheldReasons": [],
          "reviewId": "personal-material-20260924:mansion"
        }
      ],
